  <item>
    <title>33.放弃百万年薪成为职业教练，她发现人生是个游乐场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685c97e168e39f1304a3ed9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685c97e168e39f1304a3ed9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Jun 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在上一期节目中，我们与资深公关传播专家、职业教练 Dana 回顾了她二十多年的职业生涯，并分析了营销与公关的各自的特点和价值。</span></p><br><p><span>本期节目，我们将继续与 Dana 展开一场关于“教练”的深度对话，剖析这项越来越流行、又略显神秘的技能。</span></p><br><p><span>你将会了解到</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">00:02:06</a>】教练是什么</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a>】底层逻辑，与心理咨询的区别</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">00:08:00</a>】教练是如何工作的</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">00:20:16</a>】如何选择适合你的教练</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">00:22:21</a>】教练行业的发展与收费</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">00:29:00</a>】教练真的有那么神奇吗</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2619">00:43:39</a>】教练的成长之路</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2837">00:47:17</a>】职场中的教练式沟通</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3095">00:51:35</a>】人生是个游乐场</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3439">00:57:19</a>】轨道和旷野都是你的游乐场</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3852">01:04:12</a>】做教练能否年入百万</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">01:08:40</a>】自由职业的苦与乐</span></p>]]></description>
