  <item>
    <title>30.串台 唯真为善的传理人｜传理校友Joanna，从奥美到财经企业传播人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678907ca7d09c741fcf66a81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678907ca7d09c741fcf66a81</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2025 12:44:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《唯真为善的传理人》是香港浸会大学的校友访谈栏目，将邀请校友回到校园，回忆校园故事，分享成长历程、行业发展、职场干货、香港职场、香港生活等内容。</span></p><br><p><b><span>嘉宾介绍</span></b></p><p><span>主持人：黄磊Vincent</span></p><p><span>传理学文学硕士课程主任</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：Joanna Zhang</span></p><p><span>10年数字营销人</span></p><p><span>前博然思维、奥美策划</span></p><p><span>香港浸会大学兼职讲师</span></p><br><p><b><span>时间轴：</span></b></p><p><span>就读篇：</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">00:03:07</a>】如何转专业？为什么选香港浸会大学？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">00:10:02</a>】从内地到香港都有哪些转变？有什么印象深刻的事情？</span></p><p><span>职场篇1：</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">00:15:06</a>】毕业选择去哪个城市，你是如何做选择？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">00:16:13</a>】毕业后的第一份工作，奥美的工作体验？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">00:18:35</a>】在奥美，印象深刻的案例？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">00:21:40</a>】好的营销与社会情绪的关系探讨</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">00:22:59</a>】经济环境下行，品牌的价值在哪？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">00:26:02</a>】毕业生如何选择行业和职位？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">00:28:06</a>】在香港工作的感受？与内地的不同之处</span></p><p><span>生活篇：</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">00:31:16</a>】香港的多元化生活，在香港过上了“向往的生活”</span></p><p><span>职业篇2:</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">00:36:57</a>】从奥美广告行业转向财经公关的经历</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">00:39:13</a>】如果转变赛道？需要什么能力和心态？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">00:43:11</a>】财经公关和其他行业的公关有什么区别？</span></p><p><span>教学篇：</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">00:46:47</a>】教学经历和感受</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">00:49:08</a>】教学生涯中，能留下深刻印象的学生的特质？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3043">00:50:43</a>】教学给你带来了什么影响？</span></p><p><span>情感篇：</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">00:52:48</a>】情感状况？如何在香港找对象？</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3401">00:56:41</a>】香港的约会地点推荐</span></p><p><span>职业篇3:</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">00:58:58</a>】在香港找工作有什么旁门左道？</span></p><p><span>尾声：</span></p><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3869">01:04:29</a>】给学弟学妹的一句话</span></p>]]></description>
