  <item>
    <title>29. MBTI 能造福职场吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66aee3bdc8295bd902d828b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66aee3bdc8295bd902d828b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Aug 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>MBTI类型，你真的用对了吗？</span><br></p><br><p><span>Tina，一个穿梭于香港上海、在各种外企、中资、甲方、乙方及创业公司游刃有余的营销人。她将MBTI理论融入职场，实现了自我认知与职业发展的完美结合。她的故事，不仅是一次自我发现的旅程，更是一本职场生存指南。</span><br></p><br><p><span>让我们一起聆听她的分享，解锁职场智慧。</span></p><br><p><span>嘉宾介绍</span><br><span>Tina：资深数字营销专家，横跨广告、医疗及快消行业</span><br><br><span>本期主播</span><br><span>Joanna：数字咖啡馆创始人，关注海外数字营销及产品</span><br><br><span>你将会了解到</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">00:03:51</a>】说说你的MBTI类型</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">00:08:59</a>】获取能量：E 外向 - I 内向</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">00:11:48</a>】理解信息：S 实感 - N 直觉</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">00:15:14</a>】决策依据：T 思考 - F 情感</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">00:22:56</a>】生活态度：J 判断 - P 感知</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">00:24:47</a>】如何与不同类型的同事协作</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">00:44:54</a>】用荣格八维了解自己的优势、劣势</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4196">01:09:56</a>】经常换工作，如何规划职业路径</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4787">01:19:47</a>】区分你的工作目标和人生目标</span><br></p>]]></description>
