    <guid isPermaLink="false">634df57bffb8caaf12fd7f7c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Oct 2022 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这几年，Web 3、NFT、DAO、元宇宙，大概是你很难错过的热词。科技财经媒体、奢侈时尚品牌、互联网平台，甚至是拍卖行，都在积极参与，踊跃尝试。</span><br><br><span>但是Web 3的相关概念到底代表什么？对营销、公关人来说有什么意义？究竟是噱头还是机遇？</span><br><br><span>听听我们最新一期的节目，为你进一步解读。</span></p><p><br><span>嘉宾介绍</span><br><span>Emily Cheung: 赏游地/CREATEC/Appreciator.io 创始人</span><br><span>张晨: 奶牛快传创始人前广告公司技术总监</span><br><br><span>你将会了解到</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">00:06:04</a>】Web3、区块链、NFT 科普</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">00:12:38</a>】元宇宙就是VR吗</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">00:16:50</a>】Web3 现阶段发展</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">00:21:32</a>】DAO如何改变生产关系</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">00:29:20</a>】NFT在国内的发展情况</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">00:37:20</a>】DAO如何促进创作者和品牌方的合作</span></p>]]></description>
